(N'梅花三弄(箫)', N'10', N'youtube', N'I love how these videos are filmed, it&#39;s like a painting come to life and it adds to the beauty of the soulful music. Everything about this is just artful.', N'875', N'2025-03-21'),
(N'梅花三弄(箫)', N'10', N'youtube', N'实在是没啥文化 写个五绝吧<br><br>细雪上梅梢  万籁一支箫<br>惊闻画中语  涓涓似溪涛', N'626', N'2025-08-03'),
(N'梅花三弄(箫)', N'10', N'youtube', N'&quot;Three Stanzas” means the same tune is played three times repeatedly. This repetitive treatment aims to symbolize plum blossom&#39;s graceful  posture, unyielding personality, and progressive spirit in the cold wind. The entire composition consists of two parts, including 10 paragraphs and an epilogue. The first six paragraphs are the first part, which adopts the form of a circular body. The melody is smooth and beautiful, and the rhythm is bright. Among them, the overtone theme cycle appears three times, making the tune fresh and lively, thus highlighting the plum blossom&#39;s temperament and noble quality. The second part (paragraphs 7-10) is in sharp contrast to the previous part. The ups and downs of the melody, the rapid rhythm, and the instability in the tone and the beat all show us the firm picture of plum blossoms standing proudly in the cold wind. The second part is a static, a moving, a soft and a rigid, rigid and soft, forming a sharp contrast, as if to show us the beautiful image of plum blossoms.', N'519', N'2025-12-03'),
(N'梅花三弄(箫)', N'10', N'youtube', N'I&#39;m Korean but for my entire life I&#39;ve had this feeling at the corner of my heart that I once lived in that time and place when and where I truly had a sense of belonging. Yet in this modern world, I&#39;m utterly lost, the feeling of having lost my own tribe. If reincarnation is real, I&#39;m pretty sure I&#39;ve come and gone here in this Asian land, whether it be Ancient China or Mongol or whatever, hundreds if not thousands times. This type of music is a temporal gateway that takes me home, though only for several minutes.<br><br>Where are my brothers and sisters? Where is my true family? I miss you dearly.', N'485', N'2024-05-04'),
(N'梅花三弄(箫)', N'10', N'youtube', N'Beautiful music.  I&#39;m a flute and di zi player and I had ordered a xiao in december.  It&#39;s coming this week and I&#39;m really excited to learn the instrument.  Wish me luck friends.', N'457', N'2025-01-17'),
(N'梅花三弄(箫)', N'10', N'netease', N'我一个90后每天练着蝇头小楷种着花儿还听着这种音乐。。。妈呀我这才是老干部生活啊[大哭][呆][呆][呆]', N'382', N'2026-05-22'),
(N'梅花三弄(箫)', N'10', N'youtube', N'Perfect combination of Chinese traditional music, painting, clothing and modern technology to make this media. We are blessed to have this beautiful ancient art to new life.', N'295', N'2026-05-30'),
(N'梅花三弄(箫)', N'10', N'youtube', N'这才是中国的经典。加油自得琴社。你们是世界级别的。', N'246', N'2024-05-29'),
