(N'梅花三弄(箫)', N'10', N'youtube', N'It&#39;s like looking at a piece of Oriental painting. <br>The music and the scene are really beautiful. PERFECT!', N'35', N'2025-04-11'),
(N'梅花三弄(箫)', N'10', N'youtube', N'自得琴社要是不火那真的天理难容！', N'32', N'2025-02-09'),
(N'梅花三弄(箫)', N'10', N'youtube', N'Last week I did a lesson with my class on resilience  -- what it is and how we can develop it -- and then we painted plum blossoms using the Chinese ink painting style as plum blossoms in Chinese culture is often used to visually presented perseverance, resilience, and hope for better days. I just found this amazing piece of music today and feel like it&#39;s the missing piece to the &quot;resilience picture&quot; I was trying to impart to my students -- a concept explored from a philosophical, practical, and artistic perspective. Now, I&#39;ll use this to explore resilience through a musical lens. Thank you so much for sharing this ethereal piece of music and beautiful video with the world. Love and thanks from New Zealand!', N'31', N'2024-09-23'),
