(N'自在飞花轻似梦(箫演奏)', N'10', N'youtube', N'Evening from London and OMG this performance was amazing, word&#39;s can&#39;t explain how you feel listening to this. <br>I have always been interested in Chinese History and Culture, the Outfits were beautiful 😮❤❤❤', N'9', N'2024-06-26'),
(N'自在飞花轻似梦(箫演奏)', N'10', N'youtube', N'10月南京的桂花又香了，小时候家里有种了一颗很大的桂花树，现在已不在了。淡然回首，已不似少年', N'9', N'2025-04-27'),
(N'自在飞花轻似梦(箫演奏)', N'10', N'youtube', N'I love the beautiful pace and rhythm of this piece of music. If it were a classical European master it would likely be romping along much faster, but the wandering melody here has such perfect tension with a restraint , played almost what sound as slowly as possible without dissintegrating the musicians. Really like a river, powerful in it&#39;s continuity and it&#39;s extent. Such a pleasure to experience.  Thankyou.', N'9', N'2025-11-29'),
(N'自在飞花轻似梦(箫演奏)', N'10', N'youtube', N'刚化好妆准备出门，然后现在鼻涕一把泪一把~~ 又逢故国晚秋桂枝香，长叹千里中秋念奴娇', N'9', N'2026-06-21'),
